#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/admin/_ai_model_price_macros.html:2
msgid ""
"Check the price: input and output are required, prices are non-negative "
"numbers with at most 6 decimal places per 1M tokens, and long context "
"prices need a threshold."
msgstr ""
"Revise el precio: la entrada y la salida son obligatorias, los precios "
"son números no negativos con 6 decimales como máximo por 1M de tokens, y "
"los precios de contexto largo necesitan un umbral."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/admin/_ai_model_price_macros.html:3
msgid ""
"The period overlaps another active price of this model from the same "
"source. Deactivate or end that price first, or choose another period."
msgstr ""
"El periodo se solapa con otro precio activo de este modelo del mismo "
"origen. Desactive o finalice primero ese precio, o elija otro periodo."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/admin/_ai_model_price_macros.html:4
msgid ""
"Usage entries are priced with this price at or after that instant, so it "
"cannot be ended there or deleted. Deactivate it, or choose a later "
"instant."
msgstr ""
"Hay registros de uso valorados con este precio en ese instante o después,"
" así que no puede finalizarse ahí ni eliminarse. Desactívelo o elija un "
"instante posterior."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/admin/_ai_model_price_macros.html:5
msgid "Bundled prices cannot be deleted. Deactivate the price instead."
msgstr ""
"Los precios incluidos no se pueden eliminar. Desactive el precio en su "
"lugar."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/admin/_ai_model_price_macros.html:6
